Modifications in this fork:

  - Live refresh of the serial port list while the port dropdown is open
    (500 ms polling on a background thread, coalesced to one scan at a time).
  - Fixed the no-port busy loop in Serial.detectSerialPortProcess and the
    stale "detecting" state that made later clicks unresponsive.
  - Port items store the real device path in Qt.UserRole instead of parsing
    the display text; added natural COM ordering, macOS /dev/cu.*
    deduplication, and richer per-port tooltips.
  - Auto-update points at this fork instead of upstream releases, so a
    custom build is not replaced by an upstream binary.
  - Added unit tests, design documentation, and a CI workflow for the
    port-list helpers.

This fork remains under LGPL-3.0. The complete corresponding source is
